      "Unpleasant in plain water, per the brand's own guidance",
      "No third-party certification listed"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The best way to raise the protein in small meals without drinking another shake.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "21 g (label)",
      "Calories": "About 90",
      "Third-party tested": "None listed",
      "Best for": "Stirring into food"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "myprotein-clear-whey-isolate",
